[BK - AI SYSTEM] 
�
�
We use Arduino brain with AI weather prediction.
How AI works:
We use DHT11 sensor to read temperature and humidity in real-time.
The system uses GPT-inspired climate logic – trained on weather patterns, then converted to simple rules the
Arduino can run offline.
Instead of just monitoring, our model predicts upcoming weather and adjusts watering before conditions
change.
Example: If sensors detect rising heat and dropping humidity, AI predicts hot day tomorrow and increases
watering today. This prevents plant stress.
Also has:
Environmental cooling mist when too hot
Safety sensors stop system if something breaks
Remote control capability
This makes it innovative and future-ready.
[AK - WHY AI MATTERS] 
