Here's the big difference: Most systems just react. Ours predicts.
Traditional systems water on fixed schedules. If weather changes suddenly, plants suffer.
Our AI combines sensors with climate prediction. It waters plants based on what's coming, not just what's
happening now.
Result: Less water wasted, healthier plants, better yields.
